====== NETGEAR R6900 v2======
/* This template is intended to be used via https://openwrt.org/meta/create_new_device_page . */
//The Netgear R6900v2 is an AC1900 simultaneous dual band N/AC (2.4 & 5 GHz) WiFi router with three removable external antennas. It features four Gbit LAN ports, one Gbit WAN port, dual core (quad thread) MIPS CPU, 128 MB NAND flash ROM, 256 MB RAM, and USB 3.0 port.//

It is based on the MT7621AT and MT7615E chips and has several clones of the same FCC ID [[https://fccid.io/PY316200344|PY316200344]]: 
Nighthawk AC2100 and [[toh:hwdata:netgear:netgear_ac2400|AC2400]], [[toh:netgear:r6700_v2|R6700v2]], [[toh:netgear:r6800|R6800]], and R7450

Support for this device and the R7450 were added in 22.03.00 when the [[toh:hwdata:netgear:netgear_ac2400|AC2400]], [[toh:netgear:r6700_v2|R6700 v2]], and [[toh:netgear:r6800|R6800]] were already supported. Differences in clones include no USB 2.0 port and a Guest WiFi LED replacing the USB 2.0 LED.

Prior to 22.03, R6800 firmware installed and worked fine. NOTE: R6800 is pictured but identical.

